Z||000000||sid1200||03-17-2000||02:34 AM||||Drove a 92 Turbo MR2 yesterday.  My cousin is looking for a car, and the spoiled brat   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> (19) almost has enough money to get one.  Afterwards I had a hard time driving my 88GT with 27k on it back home.  Very sad to say.  This MR2 flies , unbelievable, smooth, the power steering is great, Ttops, subs, etc.  Its funny, basically what the fiero could have/would have been if GM didn't kill it, although a bigger trunk and a usuable front trunk.  Well what can I say, I though about selling my GT and getting the MR2, but decided that I will get one when I can afford both.  Great car, all I can say, tight construction also, better than a fiero I would say esp considering the T-top's.  ||||reg||1
